     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Character and comparison",
     "texto": [
      "**Ο χαρακτήρας** means character. Some common adjectives are **ευγενικός** (kind), **αστείος** (funny) and **ήσυχος** (calm).",
      "To compare, put **πιο** before the adjective: **πιο ήσυχη από την αδελφή της** (more calm than her sister). The adjective agrees with the person described."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
